    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φάρος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Pharos,</i> an island in the bay of Alexandria, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.355
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.104
			</span></i>, etc.; famous for its lighthouse, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.6
			</span></i>, etc.: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φάριαι</span></b> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπιαὶ Φάριαι</span>
			the watch-tower <i>of Pharos,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Appell.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>lighthouse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.671
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.117
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>).</div>
